      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:ot.pss.bohairic_ed:69",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲕⲙⲟⲩⲧⲉ ⲉⲣⲟⲓ ϫⲉⲟⲩϩⲟⲣ **ⲙⲁ** ⲛⲁⲓ ⲛⲛⲉⲥⲣⲉϥⲣⲉϥ ·",
      "english": "Thou hast called me a dog, give me, then, the crumbs.",
